    <statement><p>For each of the finite geometric series given below, indicate the
number of terms in the sum and find the sum.  For the value of the
sum, enter an expression that gives the exact value, rather than
entering an approximation.</p>
<p><alert>A.</alert>
<m>2 + 2 (0.2) + 2 (0.2)^2 + \cdots + 2 (0.2)^{11}</m></p>
<p>number of terms = <fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>value of sum = <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><alert>B.</alert>
<m>2 (0.2)^{5} + 2 (0.2)^{6} + 2 (0.2)^{7} + \cdots + 
    2 (0.2)^{12}</m></p>
<p>number of terms = <fillin characters="5" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p>value of sum = <fillin characters="35" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>12</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>2.49999998976</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>8</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
